---
layout: null
permalink: /assets/site-stats.json
sitemap: false
---
{%- comment -%}
  页脚用的全站统计。作为普通页面在所有文章之后生成，所以读到的是文章转换后的正文。
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign total_chars = 0 -%}
{%- for post in site.posts -%}
  {%- assign post_text = post.content | strip_html | strip_newlines | replace: ' ', '' | replace: '　', '' -%}
  {%- assign post_chars = post_text | size -%}
  {%- assign total_chars = total_chars | plus: post_chars -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- assign total_wan = total_chars | divided_by: 10000 -%}
{%- assign total_remainder = total_chars | modulo: 10000 -%}
{%- assign total_qian = total_remainder | divided_by: 1000 -%}
{%- capture chars_label -%}{%- if total_wan > 0 -%}{{ total_wan }}万{%- if total_qian > 0 -%}{{ total_qian }}千{%- endif -%}{%- else -%}{{ total_chars }}{%- endif -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{"posts": {{ site.posts | size }}, "chars": {{ total_chars }}, "charsLabel": {{ chars_label | jsonify }}}
